{
  "about": "Vectors for the register of signed statements (DEC-0063). statements: signingStatement(type, fields) is the UTF-8 RFC 8785 form of {type, ...fields}; for a passkey type, signingChallenge is its SHA-256 (base64url here), the WebAuthn challenge. refusals: inputs that have no statement. rpIds and origins: the signing RP (isSigningRpId, originWithin). assertions: verifySigningAssertion(assertion, credential, type, fields) with the EdDSA test passkey of fixtures/vectors/estate-record.json (keys.passkeyEdDSA; Ed25519 is deterministic, so a port reproduces each sig). The share grant's jkt is RFC 7638 §3.1's example thumbprint. Never real credentials.",
